    ],
    "disclosure": {
      "revision": "disc-3964bb84c410",
      "text": "Open an attached ngrok TLS passthrough route. Initial nonce proof checks the owned forwarding gate before application traffic starts. Status retains the original proof time; safe automatic reproof is unavailable. Application TLS bytes pass through unchanged. The synthetic proof certificate is not the application certificate and does not establish trusted application identity.",
